WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.580
Narrator: Stay calm.

2
00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:02.760
Narrator: Use HOT.

3
00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:04.530
Narrator: Don't touch.

4
00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.890
Narrator: Move people away calmly.

5
00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:17.370
Narrator: Fifteen metres before your radio - then out of sight, behind cover.

6
00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.345
Narrator: Say 'Item of Interest'.

7
00:00:19.445 --> 00:00:23.294
Narrator: Follow instructions; a wider cordon comes on instruction.

8
00:00:23.394 --> 00:00:28.230
Narrator: Hazards: fix it if safe and simple, or report it.
